WEBVTT

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.416
And really the numbers tell the story.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:07.016
Half of all American households
have no retirement savings at all.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.256
That would be zero.

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:10.960
No 401(k), no IRA, not a dime.

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:16.416
Among 55-to-64-year-olds
who do have a retirement account,

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:21.816
the median value of that account
is 104,000 dollars.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:26.136
Now, 104,000 dollars
does sound better than zero,

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:29.976
but as an annuity,
it generates about 300 dollars.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:34.256
I don't have to tell you
that you can't live on that.